    "title": "This SUV Bounces Itself Out of Sand 🏜️ #shorts",
    "description": "Stuck in a dune? This Mercedes just bounces its way out. 🏜️\n\nMercedes-Benz E-ACTIVE BODY CONTROL is a 48-volt active suspension that controls every wheel on its own. In free-driving mode it raises and lowers the body again and again, changing how hard each tire presses into the sand until they grip and the SUV rocks itself free. It can also scan the road ahead and smooth out bumps before you feel them. Plot twist: so few buyers ordered it that Mercedes dropped it from the GLE in the US.\n\nThe tow truck driver just lost a customer. 👇\n\nSubscribe to Top Techs for more mind-blowing tech in under a minute.",
